### SEC-005 evidence — open redirect

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/redirect?next=https://evil.example

# Lab: 302 Location: https://evil.example
# Secure: 400 Unsafe redirect target

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/redirect?next=//evil.example/phish

# Lab: 302
# Secure: 400

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/redirect?next=/health

# Lab: 302 Location: /health
# Secure: 302 Location: /health  (allow-listed path)
